Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Volcano erupts, spewing ash over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,surrounding areas, causing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,widespread disruption and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Taal Volcano in the Philippines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,began to erupt on January
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,12, 2020, with a phreatomagmatic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,eruption from its main crater,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,as reported by the Philippine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Institute of Volcanology
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and Seismology.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The eruption produced loud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,rumbling sounds and ash that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,affected nearby regions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,including Calabarzon, Metro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Manila, and parts of Central
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luzon and Ilocos Region,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,resulting in the suspension of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,school classes and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,work schedules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Philippine Institute of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Volcanology and Seismology
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,issued an Alert Level 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.19,0:00:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,indicating a hazardous explosive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,eruption was possible within
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.55,0:00:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,hours to days, prompting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,evacuations and precautions in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the surrounding areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Volcanic activity continued into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,2021 and 2022, with smaller
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,eruptions occurring in July 2021
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and March 2022, demonstrating
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the ongoing volatility of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,the volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The eruptions caused significant
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,disruptions to daily life,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,including the suspension of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,school classes and flights, as
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,well as environmental damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,such as the temporary drying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,up of Taal Main Crater
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lake and the destruction of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Vulcan Point.